{"translation":{"id":"cmn_cbt","name":"Biblica® 聖經，當代譯本開放資源","website":"https://ebible.org/Scriptures/details.php?id=cmncbt","licenseUrl":"https://ebible.org/Scriptures/details.php?id=cmncbt","licenseNotes":null,"shortName":"CBT","englishName":"Chinese, Mandarin: Biblica® 聖經,當代譯本開放資源 (Bible)","language":"cmn","textDirection":"ltr","sha256":"b36dae22680d13a66a36842989888505161ddf7eefb726364331d95aae2197c4","availableFormats":["json"],"listOfBooksApiLink":"/api/cmn_cbt/books.json","numberOfBooks":66,"totalNumberOfChapters":1189,"totalNumberOfVerses":30961,"languageName":"中文","languageEnglishName":"Chinese"},"book":{"id":"HEB","translationId":"cmn_cbt","name":"希伯來書","commonName":"希伯來書","title":"希伯來書","order":58,"numberOfChapters":13,"sha256":"c71c20f4d63a28829bad75e93ad858a322dc4ffcbe1d504342fa88f19253826f","firstChapterNumber":1,"firstChapterApiLink":"/api/cmn_cbt/HEB/1.json","lastChapterNumber":13,"lastChapterApiLink":"/api/cmn_cbt/HEB/13.json","totalNumberOfVerses":301},"chapter":{"number":1,"content":[{"type":"heading","content":["劃時代的啟示"]},{"type":"verse","number":1,"content":["在古代，上帝曾藉著先知多次多方向我們的祖先說話，"]},{"type":"verse","number":2,"content":["在這世界的末期，祂又藉著自己的兒子向我們說話。上帝早已立祂承受萬物，並藉著祂創造了宇宙萬物。"]},{"type":"verse","number":3,"content":["祂是上帝榮耀的光輝，是上帝本體的真像。祂用自己充滿能力的話語維繫萬物。祂洗淨了世人的罪之後，便坐在天上至高上帝的右邊。"]},{"type":"verse","number":4,"content":["祂既承受了比天使更高的名，就遠超越天使。"]},{"type":"verse","number":5,"content":["上帝從未對任何一個天使說：",{"text":"「你是我的兒子，我今日成為你父親。」","poem":1},{"noteId":0},"或說：",{"text":"「我要作祂的父親，祂要作我的兒子。」","poem":1},{"noteId":1}]},{"type":"verse","number":6,"content":["上帝差遣祂的長子到世上來時，卻說：",{"text":"「上帝的天使都要敬拜祂。」","poem":1},{"noteId":2}]},{"type":"verse","number":7,"content":["上帝提到天使的時候，只是說：",{"text":"「祂以風為使者，以火焰為僕役。」","poem":1},{"noteId":3}]},{"type":"verse","number":8,"content":["關於這兒子，祂卻說：",{"text":"「上帝啊，你的寶座永遠長存，","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"你以公義的杖執掌王權。","poem":1}]},{"type":"verse","number":9,"content":[{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"你喜愛公義，憎惡邪惡。","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"所以上帝，你的上帝，","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"用喜樂之油膏你，使你超過同伴。」","poem":1},{"noteId":4}]},{"type":"verse","number":10,"content":["此外又說：",{"text":"「主啊，太初你奠立大地的根基，","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"親手創造諸天。","poem":1}]},{"type":"verse","number":11,"content":[{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"天地都要消亡，但你永遠長存。","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"天地都會像外衣漸漸破舊，","poem":1}]},{"type":"verse","number":12,"content":[{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"你要把天地像外衣一樣捲起來。","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"天地將如衣服一樣被更換，","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"但你永遠不變，","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"你的年日永無窮盡。」","poem":1},{"noteId":5}]},{"type":"verse","number":13,"content":["上帝從未對任何一個天使說：",{"text":"「你坐在我的右邊，","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"等我使你的仇敵成為你的腳凳。」","poem":1},{"noteId":6}]},{"type":"verse","number":14,"content":["天使豈不都是服侍的靈，奉差遣為那些將要承受救恩的人服務嗎？"]}],"footnotes":[{"noteId":0,"caller":"+","text":"詩篇2·7。","reference":{"chapter":1,"verse":5}},{"noteId":1,"caller":"+","text":"撒母耳記下7·14；歷代志上17·13。","reference":{"chapter":1,"verse":5}},{"noteId":2,"caller":"+","text":"申命記32·43。","reference":{"chapter":1,"verse":6}},{"noteId":3,"caller":"+","text":"詩篇104·4。","reference":{"chapter":1,"verse":7}},{"noteId":4,"caller":"+","text":"詩篇45·6、7。","reference":{"chapter":1,"verse":9}},{"noteId":5,"caller":"+","text":"詩篇102·25‑27。","reference":{"chapter":1,"verse":12}},{"noteId":6,"caller":"+","text":"詩篇110·1。","reference":{"chapter":1,"verse":13}}]},"thisChapterLink":"/api/cmn_cbt/HEB/1.json","thisChapterAudioLinks":{},"nextChapterApiLink":"/api/cmn_cbt/HEB/2.json","nextChapterAudioLinks":{},"previousChapterApiLink":"/api/cmn_cbt/PHM/1.json","previousChapterAudioLinks":{},"numberOfVerses":14}